'IncrementalAudit.process_is_correct' depends on axioms: [propext]
'IncrementalAudit.suffix_contains_no_old_loop' depends on axioms: [propext]
'IncrementalAudit.complete_loop_has_every_result' depends on axioms: [propext, Quot.sound]
Incremental scopes: only current, acknowledged, complete-loop judgments commit.
Partial reports retain concrete source identities; uncertainty cannot advance a cursor.
Completion is not permission; user withdrawal disables execution.
Proof scope: protocol guards and source references, not classifier truth, tokenizer accuracy, or TypeScript equivalence.
